#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:5 a53e197cf3cb4d1cb3215ad0512586b7
msgid "ROS 2"
msgstr "ROS 2"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:10 043f08cdea3947df82f43effe9a874f6
msgid ""
"ArduPilot capabilities can be extended with `ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ "
"(aka Robot Operating System)."
msgstr "ArduPilot 的功能可通过 `ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ （即机器人操作系统）进行扩展。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:12 04bf254d2d334c05a092c205f49aa1c3
msgid ""
"`ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ provides libraries, tools, hardware "
"abstraction, device drivers, visualizers, message-passing, package "
"management, and more to help software developers create robot applications. "
"ROS has been superseded by `ROS2 "
"<http://design.ros2.org/articles/why_ros2.html>`__, and ArduPilot now "
"natively supports it through its library `AP_DDS "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_DDS>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ "
"提供库、工具、硬件抽象、设备驱动、可视化工具、消息传递、包管理等功能，帮助软件开发者创建机器人应用程序。ROS 已被 `ROS 2 "
"<http://design.ros2.org/articles/why_ros2.html>`__ 所取代，ArduPilot 现通过其库 "
"`AP_DDS "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_DDS>`__ "
"原生支持 ROS 2。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:16 2c193d4cd9b5472483ae546effe73011
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:18 da9c0c7e73734563b76fdc68cac3576c
msgid ""
"Learn to use ArduPilot first by following the relevant wiki for `Rover "
"<https://ardupilot.org/rover/index.html>`__, `Copter "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/index.html>`__ or `Plane "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"请先参阅相关 wiki（`Rover <https://ardupilot.org/rover/index.html>`__、`Copter "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/index.html>`__ 或 `Plane "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`__）学习 ArduPilot 的使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:19 2fd5daac7f4240c69b339eea881a8cc3
msgid ""
"In particular, make sure the vehicle works well in Manual and Autonomous "
"modes like Guided and Auto before trying to use ROS."
msgstr "尤其要确保飞行器在手动模式以及 Guided、Auto 等自主模式下工作正常，再尝试使用 ROS。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:20 7bc87c5a54da49e1bdddf086d60ef820
msgid ""
"Learn how to use ROS 2 by reading the `beginner tutorials "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials.html>`__.  In the case of a "
"problem with ROS, it is best to ask on ROS community forums first (or google"
" your error)."
msgstr ""
"通过阅读 `入门教程 <https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials.html>`__ 学习如何使用 ROS "
"2。遇到 ROS 问题时，最好先在 ROS 社区论坛中提问（或搜索错误信息）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:22 46af704e8ce846dcb6928cbf96c0dd28
msgid ""
"We are keen to improve ArduPilot's support of ROS 2 so if you find issues "
"(such as commands that do not seem to be supported), please report them in "
"the `ArduPilot issues list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__. A maintainer can add the"
" `ROS` tag."
msgstr ""
"我们致力于改进 ArduPilot 对 ROS 2 的支持，如果您发现任何问题（例如某些命令似乎不受支持），请在 `ArduPilot issues "
"list <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ 中提交。维护者可以添加 `ROS` "
"标签。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:24 87c0dc8afe9c4e099ebcb8b696c0c502
msgid ""
"First, make sure that you have successfully installed `ROS 2 Humble "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Installation.html>`__ . Currently, ROS 2 "
"Humble is the only version supported."
msgstr ""
"首先，确保已成功安装 `ROS 2 Humble "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Installation.html>`__。目前仅支持 ROS 2 Humble 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:27 3286e2714a7f481fac8de854165bd4a0
msgid ""
"You are about to create a new `ROS 2 workspace "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-Client-"
"Libraries/Creating-A-Workspace/Creating-A-Workspace.html#id4>`__. This page "
"assumes that your workspace is named `ardu_ws` in your home directory, but "
"feel free to adjust to your preferred location."
msgstr ""
"您即将创建一个新的 `ROS 2 工作空间 <https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-"
"Client-Libraries/Creating-A-Workspace/Creating-A-"
"Workspace.html#id4>`__。本页假设工作空间名为 `ardu_ws`，位于主目录下，您可以根据个人偏好调整位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:30 5dd2e73ad3114679844f321455c7063f
msgid ""
"Before anything else, make sure that you have `sourced your ROS 2 "
"environment <https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-"
"Tools/Configuring-ROS2-Environment.html#source-the-setup-files>`__ and check"
" if it is `configured correctly "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Configuring-"
"ROS2-Environment.html#check-environment-variables>`__."
msgstr ""
"在进行任何操作之前，请确保已 `激活 ROS 2 环境 "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Configuring-"
"ROS2-Environment.html#source-the-setup-files>`__ 并检查是否 `配置正确 "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Configuring-"
"ROS2-Environment.html#check-environment-variables>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:33 277d7a88b4fe451284e626f7450d8128
msgid ""
"Finally, ensure you have `set up your ArduPilot build environment "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/building-the-code.html#setting-up-the-build-"
"environment>`__."
msgstr ""
"最后，确保已 `配置好 ArduPilot 构建环境 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/building-the-"
"code.html#setting-up-the-build-environment>`__。"

