#: ../../source/docs/ros2.rst:92 5e45c960ddd14c09aec855690deb5003
msgid ""
"⚠️ If you have installed FastDDS or FastDDSGen globally on your system: "
"eProsima's libraries and the packaging system in Ardupilot are not "
"deterministic in this scenario. You may experience the wrong version of a "
"library brought in, or runtime segfaults. For now, avoid having simultaneous"
" local and global installs. If you followed the `global install "
"<https://fast-"
"dds.docs.eprosima.com/en/latest/installation/sources/sources_linux.html#global-"
"installation/>`_ section, you should remove it and switch to local install."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ 如果您已在系统全局安装了 FastDDS 或 FastDDSGen：在此情况下，eProsima 的库与 ArduPilot "
"的打包系统行为不确定。您可能遇到引入错误版本库或运行时段错误的问题。目前请避免同时进行本地和全局安装。如果您按照 `全局安装 "
"<https://fast-"
"dds.docs.eprosima.com/en/latest/installation/sources/sources_linux.html#global-"
"installation/>`_ 步骤操作，应将其删除并切换为本地安装。"

